00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,880
There's just fraud.

254
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:49,840
So it's just a normal law.

255
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:52,120
It's not really anything special.

256
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:55,600
But yeah, so imagine that you legalize insurance fraud.

